# Everything under measurements/ is a record, whatever its extension. The rules above are
# LaTeX and build noise; they have now eaten measurement files three times -- 211 .log in
# paper-io-portability, a cited build.log in paper-quic-cid-routing, and four .out files
# that a published checksum manifest listed but the tree did not contain. The first fix
# whitelisted .log alone and the next campaign wrote .out. The problem was never the
# extension: a record can carry any file type. Scope the exemption to the path instead.
# Verified: no build writes into measurements/ in this repository.
!measurements/**
